{
  "about": "Mappings (docs/FORMATS-PLAN.md, step 4) through Clarity.Formats, one engine for every format: each case lists one input per format that can hold its data (`json`, `yaml`, `xml`, `csv`) and one expected result, which every input gives, word for word (`errors` where a message names its format). Options hold the generic mapping keys beside a format's own: `at` (slashes; dots where there is no slash), `fields` (a field's path relative to its record: names with slashes, `@name` an attribute where the format has them, `.` the record's own text, `..` the record it was found in; in a flat file a column's name), `nested` (a field holding records, with its own `at`, `fields`, `nested` and `parent`). `read` cases read and fit `kind`; `write` cases write `value` as `kind` and give `written` per format; `table` cases read a file source's table, the `#node` column left out of the comparison (each format writes its own node); `tables` cases read several tables where `nested` is given (the source's own named \"\", each nested one by its field, with its `entity`, its second column the link to its row's place, named by `parent` or `#parent`), `#node` left out, and write them back unchanged to the same input.",
  "read": [
    {
      "name": "fields: a field at a path inside its record, the records at a path",
      "kind": {
        "kind": "records",
        "entity": "Order",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "number",
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "name": "customer",
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "name": "total",
            "kind": "decimal"
          }
        ],
        "base": {
          "id": 0,
          "number": "",
          "customer": "",
          "total": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "at": "shop/orders/order",
        "fields": {
          "customer": "customer/name"
        }
      },
      "inputs": {
        "json": "{\"shop\":{\"orders\":{\"order\":[{\"number\":\"A-1\",\"customer\":{\"name\":\"Ada\"},\"total\":\"12.50\"},{\"number\":\"A-2\",\"customer\":{\"name\":\"Bo\"}}]}}}",
        "xml": "<shop><orders><order><number>A-1</number><customer><name>Ada</name></customer><total>12.50</total></order><order><number>A-2</number><customer><name>Bo</name></customer></order></orders></shop>",
        "yaml": "# the shop\nshop:\n  orders:\n    order:\n      - number: A-1\n        customer:\n          name: Ada   # the first\n        total: \"12.50\"\n      - number: 'A-2'\n        customer: {name: Bo}\n"
      },
      "fitted": [
        {
          "id": 0,
          "number": "A-1",
          "customer": "Ada",
          "total": "12.50"
        },
        {
          "id": 0,
          "number": "A-2",
          "customer": "Bo",
          "total": "0"
        }
      ]
    },
